### Files — template base (multipart e JSON)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@accessToken =
@fileId =

### Upload (campo "file" + query type obrigatório)
### Ajuste o boundary se o cliente reclamar; ou use curl/Postman para arquivos grandes.
POST {{baseUrl}}/files/upload?type=document&description=teste
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----restclientboundary

------restclientboundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="hello.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello template
------restclientboundary--

### Listar arquivos
GET {{baseUrl}}/files?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Obter por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/files/{{fileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Remover
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/files/{{fileId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
